{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"はーい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/17/3467124/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わかるかなぁー？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっと髪の毛わっくすでふんわりさせてみたんだよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/17/3467124/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ど...どう？笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"イケメン...かな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、そうそう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみ書き忘れてたけど、この間大阪であみがお好み焼き屋の店員さんとマヨビームで張り合った事が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなのブログでバレちゃってたねっΣ(￣。￣ﾉ)ﾉ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"物珍しいことをやってる人見るとどうしても自分もやりたくなってしまう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それが......能條愛未（17）。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/17/3467124/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぎゃ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういや今日の暑さ尋常じゃなかったが、皆、無事生きてるだろうか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみはというと、氷みたいなやつ（まあだいたいどんなのかってのは察して。）を、脇にそれぞれ2個。首に3個。足にそれぞれ2個。様々な方法でこの暑さをしのいでたの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分の身は自分で守るのよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ままが言ってた......。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい質問返すよーーー＼(^o^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ あみあみは恋愛映画とか見ますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もし見るなら何が一番オススメですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.観ます観ますー！！オススメは、僕等がいた。定番かな？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ 今週の握手会と彼女とデートどっちを優先したらいい！？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.ええーー！そ、それあみが決めていいのかぁ？？  (´༎ຶ۝༎ຶ)......自分の心に正直に、行きたい方に行きましょ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ 最近、爆笑しすぎて、おかしくなりそうになったこと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありますか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.全然あるよおっ！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...最近爆笑する事多すぎて覚えてないや。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ 俺は東京よみうりランドであみあみとせいらりんと握手する時に頭をぶつけてました(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"俺のこと覚えてくれてますか？(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.もちろん。覚えてるよ(^ ^)！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ あみあみはディズニーランドに行ったの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.この間はランドじゃなくてシーに行ったよ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ あみあみのブログは毎日書いてもいいですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.ん？いいんだよ(^ ^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.元気でるように、あみからパワーをくれませんか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.............っだぁっっっ！！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今あみのPower送ったよ。届いた？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ あみあみは勉強とスポーツどっちの方が得意？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.そうだなぁーースポーツの方が好きだな～。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.好きな男子の髪型ってどんなのがいいですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度の握手会でその髪型で行きたいと思います"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.ワックスでふんわりさせてる感じ。とにもかくにも清潔感！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ ディズニーのアトラクションで何が1番好きなの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.スペースマウンテンかな？？あれは楽しい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ あみあみはどんなキャラクターが好きなの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.どんな？んーきもかわ！！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ .全握であみあみモノマネしてーって言った奴だけどわかる？そしたら、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やまとまとって言ってモノマネしてくれたんだけど覚えてるかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.あっ！覚えてるよ！！めちゃくちゃ似てなくて本当ごめん ( ◞˟૩˟)◞"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ 去年まで高校球児だったんだけど高校野球は好き？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.ごめんなさい！野球は嫌いじゃないけどルールがちんぷんかんぷんなの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はここまでーー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/17/3467124/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな今日もだいすっき。"}],"source":"archive"}